# PEP 561 — this package ships type information.
#
# Without this file every consumer running mypy reads `ds_auth`, `ds_obs`,
# `ds_edc` and `ds.governance` as `Any`: `import-untyped` at the import, and
# then no checking at all of the calls that follow. That was 57 of the 136
# type errors across this repository, and worse than the count suggests —
# the silence was mistaken for cleanliness.
#
# Every one of these packages is annotated already. The marker is the
# declaration that they are, and hatchling ships it because it lives inside
# the package directory.
#
# ds asked celine-utils for exactly this (see the celine store,
# `governance-api-admits-subclasses`); shipping it here is the same argument
# applied to our own libraries.
